    <description>Stores content copy records for the Copy Center cockpit, one record per message variant. Each record is associated with a channel and activation type, holds the message body and subject, tracks status (Draft/Ready/Published), and records validity dates. Commonly used for multichannel CRM communication authoring, versioning, and channel-specific copy management.</description>
